.github/workflows/d8-optin.md: info: Tip: set permissions.copilot-requests: write to use GitHub Actions token-based inference with the Copilot engine instead of a personal access token (COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN). This option requires that your organization has centralized Copilot billing enabled and may not be available in all organizations. To suppress this tip when using a PAT, set permissions.copilot-requests: none — see https://github.github.com/gh-aw/reference/billing/ for details.

i d8-optin.md: no model or engine.model-routing is set, so the copilot engine uses model routing with goal cost and mode auto on GitHub Copilot inference. Set engine.model-routing: false to opt out, or choose a model. A nonempty vars.GH_AW_MODEL_AGENT_COPILOT or vars.GH_AW_DEFAULT_MODEL_COPILOT bypasses routing at run time. See https://github.github.com/gh-aw/reference/model-routing/
